<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "land a fleet join's answer: the face stands on this vessel"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.fleet.lands", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.lands"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.lands"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.lands ~ the face lands on the joining vessel

`lares fleet join land <answer-file>` runs on the joining place with no vessel standing: it reads the answer under the root key its kept offer named, opens the sealed address secret, founds the face's device edge and lands the face. A record or secret this vessel holds otherwise refuses.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`land` params=`answer/answer.json ~ land the face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ answer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`answer` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<answer-file> ~ the answer file the root holder wrote`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ runs in this process on the joining vessel, no vessel standing; its keys mint and stay here`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ answer-absent · answer-unread · join-absent · record-other · secret-other · charter-refused · admit-refused · bootstrap-torn · face-joinee · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`answer-absent` params=`cure/[[face.fleet.lands answer/answer.json]] ~ name the answer file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`answer-unread` params=`~ the file reads as no JSON`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`join-absent` params=`~ no join stands pending; request one first`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`record-other` params=`~ this vessel holds the face's record under another root key`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`secret-other` params=`~ this vessel holds another address secret for the face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`charter-refused` params=`~ the seed charter refused`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`admit-refused` params=`~ the admit refused`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bootstrap-torn` params=`~ the bootstrap reads torn; nothing written over it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-joinee` params=`~ the joinee names no face; the face rides the offer, and face= belongs to offer and answer`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the land refused by name (FleetJoinRefused, a store door refusal, or StoreHeld); the line names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 ~ the face stands here; lares vessel stand with-web=true next`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares fleet join land]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

